        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-4071] If SECC is using ServiceName = DC_ACDP, after receiving the ACDP_ConnectReq, the SECC shall respond with a ACDP_ConnectRes with EVSEProcessing set to \"Ongoing\" within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 215 while the device connection is still ongoing. The next allowed request shall be ACDP_ConnectReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 215.",
