        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-4072] If SECC is using ServiceName = DC_ACDP, after receiving the ACDP_ConnectReq, the SECC shall respond with a ACDP_ConnectRes with EVSEProcessing set to \"Finished\" within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 215, when the device connection has finished. The next allowed request shall be DC_CableCheckReq if ServiceName = DC_ACDP or DC_ACDP_BPT in Table 204 was selected and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 215.",
