            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-4073] If SECC is using ServiceName = DC_ACDP in Table 204, after receiving the PowerDeliveryReq with ChargeProgress set to \"Stop\", the SECC shall respond with PowerDeliveryRes containing \"ResponseCode=OK\" within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 215. The allowed next request shall be ACDP_DisconnectReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 215.",
