        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-4074] After receiving the ACDP_DisconnectReq, the SECC shall respond with ACDP_DisconnectRes containing \"ResponseCode = OK\" and \"EVSEProcessing=Ongoing\" within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 215, if the processing of the information is successfully passed and the ACDP_Disconnect is ongoing. The allowed next request shall be ACDP_DisconnectReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 215.",
