        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-4075] After receiving the ACDP_DisconnectReq, the SECC shall respond with ACDP_DisconnectRes containing \"ResponseCode = OK\" and \"EVSEProcessing=Finished\" within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 215, if the charging device is in the home position as defined in IEC 61851-23-1. The allowed next request shall be SessionStopReq and V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 215.",
